  "details": "What device are you using?\n\nIPhone 14\n\nWhat iOS version is installed?\n\n17.5.1\n\nWhat VRChat Build Number is installed? (You can find this in Testflight)\n\n2024.2.3 (333)\n\nDescription of the Issue:\n\nThe double tap to move mechanic is still active on VRC Pickup UI Buttons. This can make it harder to use things that some worlds have VRC Pickup integrated with, like the guns in \"Zombie Survival\" or any other object that requires it to be used more than once\n\nWhat do you expect to happen?\n\nThe double tap to move is disabled for the VRC Pickup UI Buttons like it is with the Jump, Menu, Mic and Joystick buttons\n\nWhat happens instead?\n\nDouble tapping on the Drop or Use item button causes the player to move as if it were any other part of the screen",
